# Data Classification, Lifecycle, and Retention

> Conditional entry point. Generation does not establish that this artifact
> applies or that any data handling is acceptable.

## Applicability assessment

- Status: `not_assessed`
- Triggers: personal, confidential, licensed, regulated, or production data
- Assessed on: not assessed
- Assessor and basis: not assessed

Record the durable assessment on conceptual type `DAT-0001` in the artifact
registry. `applicable` or `not_applicable` requires `assessed_on`,
`assessed_by`, and a rationale; retain a not-applicable type record after
removing its physical representation.

If a trigger applies, record data classes, owners, stores, flows,
minimization, access, retention, deletion, incident handling, and validation
evidence without placing real sensitive values in the dossier. If no trigger
applies, omit the physical representation only after recording the durable
type-level assessment.
